# The Question (Ren'Py sample game, MIT) built with `rpy2psp build`: title, dialogue,
# a menu choice, save to slot 1, two more lines, then load slot 1. Text types at
# 40 cps, so presses are 5 s apart and shots are taken 4.5 s after a press.
3.0 shot title
4.0 press X        # Start
8.5 shot lecture
9.0 press X
14.0 press X
19.0 press X
24.0 press X
28.5 shot uni
29.0 press X
33.5 shot sylvie
34.0 press X
39.0 press X
44.0 press X
48.5 shot menu
49.0 press DOWN     # second choice: To ask her later
50.0 shot menu-down
50.5 press X
55.0 shot chosen
55.5 press START    # game menu (cursor on Return)
56.5 shot gamemenu
57.0 press DOWN     # Save
57.5 press X
58.5 shot savescreen
59.0 press X        # slot 1
60.5 shot saved
61.0 press O
62.0 press O
63.5 shot after-save
64.0 press X
69.0 press X
73.5 shot advanced
74.0 press START
75.0 press DOWN
75.5 press DOWN     # Load
76.0 press X
77.0 shot loadscreen
77.5 press X        # slot 1
79.0 shot load-confirm
79.5 press UP       # Yes
80.0 press X
84.5 shot after-load
85.5 end
